---
import RootLayout from "../layouts/RootLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/Heading.astro";

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<RootLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Chhatresh Khatri" 
  description="Privacy policy and data handling practices for chhatreshkhatri.com and its subdomains." 
  keywords="Privacy Policy, Chhatresh Khatri Privacy, Terms, Data Handling"
>
  <SectionHeading>Privacy Policy</SectionHeading>
  <section class="w-full transition duration-500 ease-out delay-100 starting:opacity-0 starting:translate-y-2.5">
    <div class="relative group rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 bg-white/40 dark:bg-surface-card/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-black/5 dark:border-white/10 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-brand-primary/40 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-r from-brand-primary/10 via-purple-500/5 to-brand-secondary/10 opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100 -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-5 text-sm md:text-base text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-left">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-b border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 pb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit">Privacy Policy for chhatreshkhatri.com and Subdomains</h2>
          <p class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Effective Date: January 1, {currentYear}</p>
        </div>
        <p>
          Thank you for visiting chhatreshkhatri.com. Your privacy is respected and protected. This Privacy Policy outlines the minimal information collected and how it is handled when you browse this website and its official subdomains. By using this website, you consent to the practices described in this policy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">1. Collection of Information</h2>
        <p><strong>1.1 Voluntary Contact:</strong> This website does not require user registration or account creation. When you contact me directly via email or communication links, your email address and any details you provide are used solely to reply to your inquiry.</p>
        <p><strong>1.2 Anonymous Usage &amp; Analytics:</strong> To assess site traffic and system performance, non-personally identifiable usage information may be monitored (such as aggregate page views, browser type, and referrer). Real-time traffic indicators (such as the Visits Counter badge) operate anonymously to record general page hits without tracking personal user profiles.</p>
        <p><strong>1.3 Cookies &amp; Local Storage:</strong> This website uses lightweight client-side storage solely to preserve essential UI preferences, such as your selected dark or light theme mode. No third-party behavioral advertising cookies or invasive cross-site trackers are used.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">2. Use of Information</h2>
        <p>Any technical or contact information collected is used strictly for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>Responding directly to recruitment, professional collaboration, or project inquiries.</li>
          <li>Ensuring website availability, stability, and fast performance across global edge networks (Cloudflare).</li>
          <li>Maintaining theme and viewing preferences across browsing sessions.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">3. Third-Party Services &amp; Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          This website is hosted and secured through Cloudflare edge infrastructure and may fetch dynamic portfolio data via a dedicated Cloudflare Worker API. These infrastructure providers process technical networking requests securely and strictly in accordance with modern data privacy and encryption standards.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">4. No Advertising or Data Selling</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not host third-party advertisements, affiliate links, or commercial ad networks. Your personal data is never sold, rented, or monetized in any form.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">5. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This portfolio contains links to external platforms (such as GitHub, LinkedIn, live demo websites, and credential verification portals). I am not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party external domains; please review their respective privacy policies when visiting them.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">6. Security</h2>
        <p>
          Standard modern security practices—including end-to-end HTTPS/TLS encryption and strict CORS controls on API communication—are implemented to safeguard communications and data transmission across all routes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-extrabold bg-linear-to-r from-heading-start to-heading-end bg-clip-text text-transparent w-fit pt-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy questions or inquiries regarding this website, feel free to reach out directly at: <a href="mailto:ck@chhatreshkhatri.com" class="text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-semibold hover:underline transition-all duration-300">ck@chhatreshkhatri.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 mt-2 border-t border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          <p>This Privacy Policy applies to chhatreshkhatri.com and its direct subdomains.</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Last updated: {currentYear}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</RootLayout>
